{"page":1,"results":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":4378371,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Dominik Litwiniak","original_name":"Dominik Litwiniak","popularity":0.3495,"profile_path":null,"known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"id":1150275,"title":"Kicia Kocia na pikniku","original_title":"Kicia Kocia na pikniku","overview":"Adored by the youngest, the resolute cat faces new adventures. Together with her faithful friends Pacek, Adelka and Julian she will go to the pool, beach and, of course, on a picnic! We'll also see how she meets a new friend while playing ball, learns an important lesson by playing store, and visits her uncle in the countryside, where she delights in his new tractor! The movie stories based on Anita Glowinska's beloved books are the perfect opportunity for an unforgettable screening at the cinema. The series \"Kitten\" on the big screen!","poster_path":"/4Q87J4F5afWOPOyfj2Eo0I32tD2.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"pl","genre_ids":[16,10751],"popularity":1.2621,"release_date":"2023-08-11","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.0,"vote_count":1},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"id":1205455,"title":"Kitty Kotty for Christmas","original_title":"Kicia Kocia pod choinkę","overview":"Kitty Kitten is a heartwarming animated children's movie that follows her adventures at the library, on a train, and in the snow with friends. From building snowmen to baking cookies with her grandmother, Kitty's life is full of excitement. Discovering the wonders of railroads with her dad and bouncing back from illness with her vigilant mother, Kitty's journey is a charming winter tale filled with joy and friendship.","poster_path":null,"media_type":"movie","original_language":"pl","genre_ids":[16,10751],"popularity":0.9554,"release_date":"2023-12-08","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"id":1254040,"title":"Smutne potwory","original_title":"Smutne potwory","overview":"The Princess is 6 years old and has the best dad in the world. Only she knows that her dad is really a brave knight who fights a terrible monster. The worst are the nights when Mom is on duty at the hospital and Princess is left home alone. if Dad doesn't come back for a long time, it's a sign that the monster may attack....","poster_path":null,"media_type":"movie","original_language":"pl","genre_ids":[18,14],"popularity":1.2857,"release_date":"2013-09-09","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0}]}],"total_pages":1,"total_results":1}